/PRO 27

> _      _    PAUSE 50
              XMESSAGE "BUNKER BLUES\nby Nate Taylor, with thanks to David Etherton\n"
              PROCESS process_anykey
              MESSAGE "You wake up alone, surrounded by the metal walls of the airlock, with only the dim emergency light overhead.\n\nYou're not sure how many hours it has been since Joe pushed you in the airlock, and you passed out from the smoke of the fire. He said he was still going to try to put it out, and deal with the damage from the earthquake that started it, but you worry now that he might not have made it.\n\nBut the air in here won't last forever, the survival suit you threw on had no helmet, and there is no way to open the external door without electricity, even if you dared to enter the wasteland without more protection.\n"


/PRO 28

> I      _    SET has_done_something_
              NEWLINE
              OK
              NEWLINE

> LOOK   _    SET has_done_something_
              CLS
              RESTART

> X      _    SET has_done_something_
              SYSMESS 63
              DONE

> GET    ALL  DOALL 255

> GET    _    SET has_done_something_
              AUTOG
              DONE

> DROP   _    SET has_done_something_
              AUTOD
              DONE

> DROP   ALL  DOALL 254

> QUIT   _    SET has_done_something_
              QUIT 
              GOTO 0
              END
              DONE

> SAVE   _    SET has_done_something_
              XSAVE 0
              RESTART

> LOAD   _    SET has_done_something_
              XLOAD 0
              RESTART

> LOOK   _    SET has_done_something_
              PLUS 29 128
              CLS
              RESTART


